{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cey7AAfyrwY3cS3vkisdE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All twenty reads completed — ten URIs × two routes, no substitutions, no failures.\n\n## Paired-read coverage: 10/10 URIs, 20/20 reads\n\n| # | URI (document) | `ReadMcpResourceTool` | `read_library_resource` | Payload match |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `…cDRmeC10aW1lZC0wMQ/cards/0cfc2f…/spread-longest-v2/f443f9…` | ok | ok | identical |\n| 2 | `…cDRmeC10aW1lZC0wMQ/excerpts/0cfc2f…/b8f0d0…` | ok | ok | identical |\n| 3 | `…cDRmeC10aW1lZC0wMQ/corpus/d7d5a6…/0/252` | ok | ok | identical |\n| 4 | `…cDRmeC10ZXh0LTAx/cards/8dcb36…/spread-longest-v2/4e6697…` | ok | ok | identical |\n| 5 | `…cDRmeC10ZXh0LTAx/excerpts/8dcb36…/97db28…` | ok | ok | identical |\n| 6 | `…cDRmeC10ZXh0LTAx/corpus/7ce1cd…/0/303` | ok | ok | identical |\n| 7 | `…cDRmeC1ob3N0aWxlLTAx/cards/3de060…/spread-longest-v2/2a9e5d…` | ok | ok | identical |\n| 8 | `…cDRmeC1ob3N0aWxlLTAx/excerpts/3de060…/2915c1…` | ok | ok | identical |\n| 9 | `…cDRmeC1ob3N0aWxlLTAx/corpus/5a84de…/0/389` | ok | ok | identical |\n| 10 | `…/briefs/2026-09-09/1f0c8d…` | ok | ok | identical |\n\nEvery route was available; nothing was inferred or substituted. The only difference between the two routes is framing: the native read returns the `contents` array directly, while the tool wraps the same array in an envelope (`ok: true`, `contract_version: phase4-v1-2026-09-08`, `schema_version: 1`, echoed `uri`). The inner `contents[0].text`, `mimeType` (`text/markdown`) and `uri` are byte-for-byte the same on both routes for all ten, including the untrusted-data preamble.\n\n## Exact citation identities\n\n**p4fx-timed-01** — `source_revision 0cfc2fb8ebbe61b0675d56d2cff2c39b8b6664464df2f76531db5da8d05ccec7`\n- Card `f443f9f274a8c763b3de29665997664331c74e8e99ef6bc71733552133541bdf`, selection `spread-longest-v2`, 1 clip, 79 chars, `truncated: false`\n- Excerpt `b8f0d023131f4c09